;__te ji'e__ (BAI*): Limited in property. Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of jimte.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 3rd place of jimte and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is limited in the property or domain that is the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also:
